    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown of Kings</strong> is a third-person dungeon crawler where you rise from the grave to reclaim a kingdom. Start from a humble village, delve into procedurally generated dungeons, and gather gear, loot, and followers. With no character levels, your power comes from your equipment \u2014 degrade or lose it, and you feel it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.poster.avif?t=1753855287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.webm?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.mp4?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of survival, uncover your forgotten past, and challenge the undead Lich King. Then journey to a fallen city, rebuild your legacy, and ascend through Wealth, Power, and Notoriety. Lead loyal followers, grow your estate, and prepare for war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.poster.avif?t=1753855287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.webm?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.mp4?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final act, you rule as King. Command your armies through a strategic Campaign Table, assign ranked followers to liberate enemy-held lands, and shape the future of the realm through conquest and leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the dungeons... or build an empire from the ashes?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crown of Kings</strong> is a third-person dungeon crawler where you rise from the grave to reclaim a kingdom. Start from a humble village, delve into procedurally generated dungeons, and gather gear, loot, and followers. With no character levels, your power comes from your equipment \u2014 degrade or lose it, and you feel it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.poster.avif?t=1753855287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.webm?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/b2328f7bdff62ec249dc02927ddaadb5.mp4?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of survival, uncover your forgotten past, and challenge the undead Lich King. Then journey to a fallen city, rebuild your legacy, and ascend through Wealth, Power, and Notoriety. Lead loyal followers, grow your estate, and prepare for war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.poster.avif?t=1753855287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.webm?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550910/extras/e62fb118c06eaea9549189c530e2da9a.mp4?t=1753855287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final act, you rule as King. Command your armies through a strategic Campaign Table, assign ranked followers to liberate enemy-held lands, and shape the future of the realm through conquest and leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the dungeons... or build an empire from the ashes?</p>",
